---@overload fun(self: World, event: "chunk_generated", handler: fun(event: ChunkEvent)): Subscription
---@overload fun(self: World, event: "chunk_unload", handler: fun(event: ChunkEvent)): Subscription
---@overload fun(self: World, event: "furnace_smelt", handler: fun(event: FurnaceSmeltEvent)): Subscription
function World:on(event, handler, options) end

